  1312	front.shopping.credit_3ds.modal.title: About Authentication Service
  1313	front.shopping.credit_3ds.modal.body: |
  1314	  We have introduced 3-D Secure 2.0, which authenticates the identity of the customer for credit card payment, to provide our customers with a safer and more secure shopping experience.<br>
  1315	  This enables strict identity authentication, preventing third parties from stealing credit card information or impersonating the cardholder, and allowing customers to make credit card payments with safety.<br><br>
  1316	  ■What is 3-D Secure 2.0?<br>
  1317	  The 3-D Secure 2.0 service is an authentication service that requires two-step authentication only when the credit card company determines that the transaction is high-risk based on several factors.<br>
  1318	  If the risk is determined to be low, the order will be confirmed without requiring a password.<br><br>
  1319	  ■About Additional Authentication<br>
  1320	  When identity authentication is required at the discretion of the card issuer, additional authentication is provided through password authentication, one-time password authentication, or terminal authentication.<br>
